@startuml RestroVibes Reliability Scoring
!theme plain
title RestroVibes - Client Reliability Scoring

participant "Express API" as API
participant "ScoringEngine" as Score
participant "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Restaurateur\nDashboard" as RestaurateurUI

== SCORING ALGORITHM ==

API -> Score : calculatePenalty(userId)
Score -> DB : Fetch BookingHistory for user
DB --> Score : { no_shows, late_arrivals,\nlate_cancellations, overstays,\ncompleted, total }

Score -> Score : rawPenalty = (noShows x 0.7\n+ lateArrivals x 0.4\n+ lateCancellations x 0.3\n+ overstays x 0.15) / totalBookings
Score -> Score : completionRatio = completed / total
Score -> Score : decay = min(completionRatio x 0.15,\nrawPenalty x 0.3)
Score -> Score : penaltyScore = max(0,\nrawPenalty - decay)
Score --> API : penaltyScore = 0.23

API -> API : Classify status
note right of API : 0 - 0.15 -> "reliable"\n0.15 - 0.4 -> "at_risk"\n> 0.4 -> "flagged"
API -> DB : Update user penalty_score + status

== RESTAURATEUR VIEWS CLIENT RISK ==

RestaurateurUI -> API : GET /api/appointments/:id
API -> DB : Fetch appointment + client risk data
API --> RestaurateurUI : { appointment, clientRisk:\n{ status, penaltyScore, history } }
RestaurateurUI -> RestaurateurUI : Display ClientRiskPopover\n(color-coded risk badge)

@enduml
